    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just about being perfect. it's like, even when I'm doing okay, I know it won't last. it's like i'm just waiting for the next fall. how am i supposed to keep going when the end result is always just more pain and feeling like a failure? it feels pointless.",
